### Consultar dashboard (administrador)
GET {{apiUrl}}/admin/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Listar webhooks (administrador; feature flag webhooks habilitada)
GET {{apiUrl}}/admin/webhooks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Criar webhook (administrador; feature flag webhooks habilitada)
POST {{apiUrl}}/admin/webhooks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://example.com/webhooks/suki-doces",
  "eventos": [
    "admin-notification.pedido-criado"
  ]
}

### Remover webhook (administrador; feature flag webhooks habilitada)
DELETE {{apiUrl}}/admin/webhooks/{{webhookId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Listar feature flags (administrador)
GET {{apiUrl}}/admin/feature-flags
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Atualizar feature flag (administrador)
PUT {{apiUrl}}/admin/feature-flags/webhooks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ativo": true
}

### Listar notificações
GET {{apiUrl}}/admin/notificacoes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Listar notificações com filtros
GET {{apiUrl}}/admin/notificacoes?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Marcar notificação como lida
PUT {{apiUrl}}/admin/notificacoes/{{notificacaoId}}/read
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Marcar todas as notificações como lidas
PUT {{apiUrl}}/admin/notificacoes/read-all
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Remover notificação
DELETE {{apiUrl}}/admin/notificacoes/{{notificacaoId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
